.TH AGENT-HOOK-SESSION-END 1 "2026-11-11" "agentguard" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
agent-hook-session-end \- run generic agent session-end maintenance
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B agent-hook-session-end
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B agent-hook-session-end
clears the agent's busy tmux pane mark with
.BR "term-pane-mark clear busy" ,
and, when the session's
.I attention-sticky
flag exists, its waiting or blocked attention mark with
.BR "term-pane-mark clear pending \-\-if sticky" ,
then reads a session-end hook JSON payload from standard input, refreshes
shared session metadata, and gives extensions a final chance to run agent or
environment-specific maintenance.
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
Session-end maintenance completed.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR agent-hook-session-end-claude (1),
.BR term-pane-mark (1)
